Package: tailscale-manager
Version: 0.2.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: llllllhui <123281846+llllllhui@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: Desktop window and system tray for Tailscale on Linux
 A GTK application with a Chinese-language management window, persistent
 system tray, exit-node selection and optional login autostart.
 Requires a separately installed and running Tailscale daemon.
